        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_56f70525dc054a4681fc4037ab369a20",
      "statement": "A composition script that derives one setup blend from another must refuse to write back over its input and must empty the blend of pre-existing actions before appending the new model rig, because several are held alive by a fake user and survive a purge, and a surviving action named T-Pose renames the appended rest-pose action so the export leads with a take under the wrong name.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Tools/Retargeting/make_lafan_corrected_setup.py#L148-L161",
